  "content": "\n\n<h1>Ссылки</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Negodya1/Twilight-Aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ceeb2af61953a1741b4cc0a9ed98302e93e5f7e1.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/742719616d0e8ce6fc10fbdae2b1eb0a24ea6ff2.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwilight-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a78e162b7b8065d2a35409066cd61e82ccc9e4fb.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/u6TjVXGT3w\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d293dd00bfd49134e3336d9137b4e5f858be2bd2.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h1>Другие моды</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vintage-kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/234b8bb8cea3a709369b45d4a0bf616d97d05499.png\" alt=\"Vintage KubeJS\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-vintage-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/911ea6bfd3d09755f02da33eab9309bbd11b4576.png\" alt=\"VintageIcon\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magic-gels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/be3d018d3a9d780462c9a722585ae1ef7d5ff8b1.png\" alt=\"MagicGelsIcon\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customizable-max-durability\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6fb6856c9be5c152c79a7627fdc17fb539615981.png\" alt=\"Настраиваемая максимальная прочность\"></a></p>\n<h1>О моде</h1>\n<p>Совместимость между <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a>. Перчатки и плащ, созданные из материалов The Twilight Forest.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/941/905/taitems.png\" alt=\"Список предметов\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/941/904/glovescraft.png\" alt=\"Пример крафта перчаток\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/941/903/capecraft.png\" alt=\"Пример крафта плаща\"></p>\n<h1>Переводы</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>en_us</li>\n<li>ru_ru</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Нужен хостинг?</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthebadguy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/25d79f00-76c2-4045-a231-62a85437014f.webp\" alt=\"Баннер\"></a></p>",
